{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/551plgz5yl3pse2k8lr3wbt5d71baiu.mp3","text":"既然你必须坐在这儿处理文件，我可以去帮你应付一些需要当场解决的问题。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/fj1dr1kyrmd2rxl91twfwtw69x8dsfm.mp3","text":"打击补给线比压制人员造成的伤害更大。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/fn7st5n9ms66y4g06zqvbwbmpwfi70a.mp3","text":"我觉得你的办公室内饰有些乏味了。要是想换个风格，可以随时来找我。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/18/h3m56y8auqls6nekihmbs5drjyp3m0v.mp3","text":"温情脉脉的家庭关系不适合我。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/ct743tnxkgi7e39imkawccmhlnasinp.mp3","text":"相比所谓的“自我提升”，和陌生人聊聊能让我受益更多。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/i384pkxwpwzrhvw7la2uwkkqt5j9l0n.mp3","text":"我们用符号定义自己，但这些符号会被扭曲，被加工，被重述——一句话，会失去原有的意义。而在符号失去意义之后，你自己又是谁？","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/8rrflwrq1t1updv46w01fvc9zuja72r.mp3","text":"我不介意在战斗之外帮你做些琐事，但在战场上，我需要足够的决策权。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/knr1bezovhqo6yvvqis11umm3xvdskr.mp3","text":"当一个人没法对你的成果挑刺，转而开始批评你的态度，你就知道他究竟有几斤几两了。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/hi1v26b0ss2r5zhxbzb4npu2l9b0kou.mp3","text":"发号施令的前提是你得证明自己足够出色，而你显然够格。好了，接下来要派我去哪？","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/re1fgcv1hk2vxd7qs4h1drs77v77qg9.mp3","text":"即使按照最高标准，你的工作也过量了。好好睡吧。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/pe3p1ybtlr56lg5vxl2jh3ge4zp8bib.mp3","text":"彩虹小队成员，代号艾拉。把目标告诉我，然后静等任务完成就好。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/2aocmv35f541pxi3pn8qwg6hwph415a.mp3","text":"学到了一些新东西。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/thxmsbhz1j4iasl2qdbezoo0pw5au23.mp3","text":"勋章？谢了，作为装饰品，工艺还挺不错。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/n33f9y491bfdku6uo68bprrw1o8mql5.mp3","text":"只要齐心合力，我们就能撼动天际繁星。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/dr5fvmini7e7gyjfk1kk5yy9v1xvpsk.mp3","text":"至少让任务有点挑战性。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/2xel18p22115l7f25hdy3b72jm4l6ch.mp3","text":"是时候让你见识一下我的实力了。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/6p7iyz4an5aotb12xb8w8aj8y02x8so.mp3","text":"没有时间可以浪费了。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/noiqbonjxjrd5h5j1xa2adu91o43udt.mp3","text":"我会让你们后悔的。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/8zdnoz9pdbwq5g7m5de3gej0ygak986.mp3","text":"以牙还牙。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/22/8725xsyznxo4rpkkcvkzw8btc5d3u93.mp3","text":"以眼还眼。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/dr1l56xg5cq7ix11u21asz5vocn47oj.mp3","text":"我来搞定。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/04/4ct1nirx31jmk33kqd5g1anlik23orh.mp3","text":"我们走。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/14kdv52m8jsu87had108ypk4wnokp92.mp3","text":"给你个纪念品。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/01/lkv6vw92fiveiwilrpsazpwnih4jxvv.mp3","text":"那会让他们慢下来的。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/bflyya4hio3wi9gzbijh9rlb4r4nklu.mp3","text":"尝尝这个！","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/1z89pqbb59iizkiv83t0h9jhwn86qlj.mp3","text":"别动！","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/a1fhcgjdfrth6cl03kst5vop6rfc8kv.mp3","text":"无论手段如何，结果才是一切。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/pbjuu3tbn8muxfcuglmljnmt5y3tw5g.mp3","text":"抱歉，我对你们来说太快了吗？","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/esvq3zlylff49a9cy1pr6f002bz9u0o.mp3","text":"这就结束了？","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/5l21xp9dwd9vk46ntvz5mwv4s0o0zzs.mp3","text":"努力坚持下去！","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/tvwvkgni8aamdh29a4t1uz8u1yr2hw4.mp3","text":"这地方还不坏。","alt":"voice/char_4123_ela/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"u